  "story": "story/cli/WORKFLOW-WORKTREE.md",
  "given": "Shared starting state; each case's own given lists only the differences. /repo is the top level of an ordinary checkout and its own canonical real path. Its common Git directory is /repo/.git. origin is https://github.com/Acme/Project.git. The current branch is main, and local branch main is at commit 1111111111111111111111111111111111111111 (M). The folders /repo/.git/pdd and /repo.pdd-worktrees do not exist. <UUID> stands for the lowercase UUIDv4 that the call generates, and <uuidShort> for its first 8 characters. The default command port runs real Git unless a case says otherwise. 'Saved run X' means an earlier allocation of run X returned ready and nothing changed after it.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "new-allocation-ready",
      "criteria": ["AC1", "AC2", "AC5", "AC12"],
      "given": "/repo has a modified tracked file source.txt and an untracked file notes.txt.",
      "input": { "function": "allocateIssueWorktree", "args": { "cwd": "/repo", "repository": "Acme/Project", "issueNumber": 101, "runId": "run-101", "workflowName": "feature", "baseRef": "main" } },
      "expected": { "state": "ready", "assignment": { "version": 1, "runId": "run-101", "repository": "Acme/Project", "issueNumber": 101, "workflowName": "feature", "commonDir": "/repo/.git", "sourceRoot": "/repo", "worktreePath": "/repo.pdd-worktrees/<UUID>", "gitDir": "/repo/.git/worktrees/<UUID>", "branch": "pdd/feature-101-<uuidShort>", "baseRef": "main", "baseSha": "1111111111111111111111111111111111111111" } },
      "effects": [
        "exactly one git worktree add -b pdd/feature-101-<uuidShort> /repo.pdd-worktrees/<UUID> 1111111111111111111111111111111111111111, run with cwd /repo",
        "before the add, /repo/.git/pdd/worktree-assignments/runs/run-101.json and /repo/.git/pdd/worktree-assignments/issues/101.json are one file with link count 2",
        "the run record holds the returned assignment as JSON and a final newline",
        "the new worktree holds the committed files of M, including the committed bytes of source.txt",
        "no fetch",
        "source.txt and notes.txt in /repo keep their bytes, and git status --porcelain in /repo is unchanged",
        "the current branch of /repo is still main, with no switch, reset or stash"
      ]
    },
